{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2023-03-13 06:30:00', 'title': "ETHISPHERE NAMES HENRY SCHEIN AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES® FOR THE 12TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC), THE WORLD'S LARGEST PROVIDER OF HEALTH CARE SOLUTIONS TO OFFICE-BASED DENTAL AND MEDICAL PRACTITIONERS, HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES, AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES. HENRY SCHEIN HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED 12 TIMES AND IS THE ONLY HONOREE IN THE HEALTHCARE PRODUCTS INDUSTRY."}